          "_name": "onearticletwo",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section mbr-id=\"_anchor\" class=\"mbr-section article content1\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n                   <header>Card</header>\n      \n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgCardColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Left/Right\" name=\"LeRi\" min=\"-20\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"-2\">\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Up/Down\" name=\"UpDo\" min=\"-20\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"20\">\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Blur\" name=\"Flou\" min=\"-1\" max=\"25\" step=\"1\" value=\"19\">\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Blur Intensity\" name=\"FlouInt\" min=\"-16\" max=\"16\" step=\"1\" value=\"-7\">\n         <input type=\"color\" title=\"Shadow Color\" name=\"ShadowColor\" value=\"#232323\">\n         \n<header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/lionaf.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n      </fieldset>\n        \n         <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#664306\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n         <input type=\"range\" name=\"angle\" title=\"Angle\" min=\"0\" max=\"270\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n\t\t <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Background Transparent\" name=\"transp\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n          \n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters> \n\t\t        <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\">\n    </div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mu-about-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Feature Content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mu-about-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image-de-fond-864x1184.webp\" alt=\"img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mu-about-right\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\"><b>Ju la Bricole</b><br></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><br>Je donne vie à vos idées. Spécialisé dans la fabrication d'objets uniques en bois et en impression 3D, je conçois des pièces entièrement personnalisables qui vous ressemblent vraiment.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t           <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-primary\" href=\"index.html#design-block-60rw6RD1Hm\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-user-2 mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n           EN SAVOIR PLUS</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- End Feature Content -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</section>",
