          "_name": "design-block",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n                   <header>Card</header>\n      \n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgCardColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Left/Right\" name=\"LeRi\" min=\"-20\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"-2\">\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Up/Down\" name=\"UpDo\" min=\"-20\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"20\">\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Blur\" name=\"Flou\" min=\"-1\" max=\"25\" step=\"1\" value=\"19\">\n         <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Blur Intensity\" name=\"FlouInt\" min=\"-16\" max=\"16\" step=\"1\" value=\"-7\">\n         <input type=\"color\" title=\"Shadow Color\" name=\"ShadowColor\" value=\"#232323\">\n         \n<header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"25\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"25\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Arrow\" name=\"showArrow\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"file:///C:/Users/Csaba/AppData/Local/Mobirise.com/Mobirise/chesswizardextra_0040gmail_002ecom/userblocks/mobirise4/header06_1/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#664306\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n         <input type=\"range\" name=\"angle\" title=\"Angle\" min=\"0\" max=\"270\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n\t\t <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Background Transparent\" name=\"transp\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n\n     \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#664306\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"container align-center\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-6 py-5 m-auto\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-regular pb-3 align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n    <div><b>Qui suis-je :</b></div></h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-left align-left mbr-regular pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing\n                    elit.</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-light pb-3 align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Depuis mon plus jeune âge, ma passion pour l'imagination et le bricolage a été nourrie par ma famille, qui m'ont transmis leur savoir-faire, enrichie par l'autodidaxie, le goût des défis techniques et véritable touche-à-tout, j'ai exploré et maîtrisé une large gamme de machines-outils.\n<br>\n<br>Fort de plus de dix ans d'expérience en impression 3D, j'ai étendu mon savoir-faire aux machines à commande numérique (laser, CNC...) – allant jusqu'à en concevoir certaines moi-même.\n<br>\n<br>Passionné d'informatique, je crée mes propres modèles de A à Z. Aujourd'hui, je mets cette expertise unique à votre service pour donner vie à toutes vos idées.&nbsp;</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"align-left mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">READ MORE</a></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 relative align-right\">\n                <img class=\"img1\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img-20240416-134542-1130x2008.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                <img class=\"img2\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-f1hgaxf1hgaxf1hg-792x1085.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-if=\"showArrow\" class=\"mbr-arrow hidden-sm-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <a href=\"#next\">\n            <i class=\"mbri-down mbr-iconfont\"></i>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</section>",
